 --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-aac486a4-51d5-4af6-9302-b88fbbb1b71e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e0e7abee-c606-40f0-a98b-91d79cd26720\">└ 추가 아이템 판매 기간 : 2025년 10월 7일(화) 05:00 ~ 2025년 10월 28일(화) 04:59</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ed4c6bd7-fe22-424f-a62d-f57618bcb782\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f0bc7c16-c285-4847-acd1-c78be92a4bd1\">└ 고철 상점의 아이템 구매 횟수는 매주 화요일 5:00에 초기화됩니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a9900f88-227b-4a66-a915-8a2353f6715f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-bef83b94-6410-4174-a341-cb3a68fca2e2\">2. 클레어 레드필드의 스페어 바디 등급이 SSR로 잘못 표기된 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e6c45f0e-433c-49e0-abda-2a92b81979be\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-aa92a76b-8b6b-4710-8021-c2d11af426d4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f7a55d39-64d0-458c-98ba-7d6ae6b6b201\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6b0c70d2-f4ed-43fa-b809-f2d9c6cea3d6\">​​​​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-21d0d997-dc7b-4444-8b48-6cb37d299baa\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-dc5331a8-0b68-4c39-9302-905c28f6eb8f\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fcd1f7cb-d116-413c-b625-3a04e5d27131\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b2210a1d-ea56-4044-947f-7cde84cabb68\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e7ff466b-7a0c-479c-8490-b9197ac05bb1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0c315a95-95c8-48ee-b4d2-13b38b6273fc\">·····················································································​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a7ccd2be-4cab-45ef-bd96-fca9cc11f1a7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a39014b2-b081-4658-acad-9e5ff3112c37\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3c68ad20-8718-4202-9969-1bc9d161c697\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4150e4a0-c82c-48a4-8ff1-9f6d07e175e8\">게임 이용에 불편을 끼쳐 드려 죄송합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-3a68f780-01d5-499b-9219-72fd12dc96ea\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-c4b06410-ff07-4dff-a3f0-9c2439728b7a\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:100px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" on